 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Gal-loving JK wants to be a gal"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ギャル推しJKはギャルになりたい"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Gal Oshi JK ha Gal ni Naritai"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Living as a gal is seriously the best!!\"\nMimuru was an introvert in middle school, but when she entered high school, she made her long-awaited debut as a gal, thinking \"Maybe I can become a gal too!?\" She made friends with three girls: Yuuhi, a cool beauty with a calm and pretty look; Fuuka, a cute gal with a soft and fluffy look; and Kurumi, a cheerful and energetic gal who is good at sports. Now she has joined the gal group she has always admired! While she lives the sparkling life she has always dreamed of, she also pushes herself too hard to keep up with her friends. And she also notices new feelings growing within her..."
  },
